WEBVTT

00:06.006 --> 00:08.758
-[birds twittering]
-[dog barking in distance]

00:23.023 --> 00:24.315
[sighs]

00:41.708 --> 00:42.792
[exhales]

01:00.643 --> 01:01.853
[Woo-jin sighs]

01:03.688 --> 01:04.606
[tuts]

01:04.689 --> 01:05.774
ACK

01:05.857 --> 01:07.150
[Woo-jin] Don't worry.

01:10.528 --> 01:13.448
You can count on me.

01:16.034 --> 01:16.868
Woo-jin.

01:19.537 --> 01:20.705
What?

01:22.624 --> 01:23.792
Your mouth stinks of poo.

01:23.875 --> 01:24.793
Hey, Gun-woo.

01:24.876 --> 01:28.213
That's not something
you say in the morning to anyone.

01:28.296 --> 01:29.714
Smell it. It's poo breath.

01:30.507 --> 01:34.177
Are you sick or you caught a cold?
We'll go to the hospital after training.

01:38.014 --> 01:39.307
[sniffs]

01:39.390 --> 01:40.350
[exhales]

01:40.892 --> 01:43.144
[coughs, sniffs]

01:43.978 --> 01:45.980
[upbeat music playing]

01:53.363 --> 01:55.031
[footsteps thudding]

01:55.115 --> 01:56.491
[groans]

01:58.493 --> 02:00.495
Oh jeez, those boys.

02:04.791 --> 02:07.043
[both sigh]

02:07.127 --> 02:08.920
-Ready! Ack!
-Ack!

02:09.003 --> 02:09.921
Go!

02:10.004 --> 02:12.507
-[rock music playing]
-[both panting]

02:13.299 --> 02:15.343
-Let's eat the competition!
-Ack!

02:27.355 --> 02:31.693
[both exhaling sharply]

02:41.828 --> 02:43.371
-[Gun-woo grunts]
-Number three!

02:46.040 --> 02:47.041
Ack!

02:47.125 --> 02:48.001
[grunts]

02:48.626 --> 02:49.669
[breathing deeply]

02:51.462 --> 02:52.463
[music fades]

02:55.258 --> 02:57.260
[tranquil music playing]

02:58.386 --> 03:00.346
-Please enjoy these.
-Yes, ma'am, thanks.

03:01.514 --> 03:02.724
-[So-yeon] Gun-woo.
-Hi, Mom.

03:02.807 --> 03:05.268
I've got a delivery!
Woo-jin, make me two espressos?

03:05.351 --> 03:06.811
-Drive safely.
-[Gun-woo] I will.

03:07.312 --> 03:08.605
Here, let's do this.

03:09.189 --> 03:10.732
-[Gun-woo] See you soon.
-[So-yeon] Okay.

03:38.259 --> 03:40.595
MOVING ON FRIDAY, 2/14
THANK YOU FOR YOUR UNDERSTANDING

03:42.597 --> 03:44.307
BUILDING 104
UNIT 1901

03:53.566 --> 03:56.236
Jeong-gwon, how about
putting that over inside there?

03:57.487 --> 03:59.405
-Yes, I ordered those.
-Here you are.

04:00.281 --> 04:01.699
Whoa!

04:02.575 --> 04:04.077
You're the boxer, Kim Gun-woo, right?

04:04.160 --> 04:05.620
-Yes, hi.
-Could I maybe…

04:05.703 --> 04:06.871
Shake? Sure.

04:07.789 --> 04:09.415
You've got a strong hand.

04:09.499 --> 04:10.541
[exhales]

04:11.167 --> 04:14.921
Ah, sorry about making you use the stairs.
There's a lot of them.

04:15.004 --> 04:17.632
No, that's okay.
I enjoy taking the stairs.

04:17.715 --> 04:21.302
It's good. I end up working muscles
I don't normally use when I'm boxing

04:21.386 --> 04:22.887
so it helps improve my balance.

04:23.471 --> 04:24.472
[gasps] Oh.

04:26.182 --> 04:27.392
You're really amazing.

04:28.101 --> 04:29.852
I'm an athlete too. In tae kwon do.

04:30.520 --> 04:31.813
Oh, whoa, wow.

04:32.981 --> 04:33.982
[music fades]

04:39.487 --> 04:40.738
You fight too?

04:42.156 --> 04:42.991
Uh, that's…

04:47.370 --> 04:49.706
I'm not a talker.
I'm so sorry for being shy.

04:50.873 --> 04:53.001
I'll root for you
in the championship match. Go win!

04:53.084 --> 04:54.460
[chuckles] Yes, win!

04:54.961 --> 04:56.087
Please enjoy!

04:56.587 --> 04:58.047
-I will.
-Good.

05:00.800 --> 05:02.427
Wow, this hand touched his.

05:03.303 --> 05:04.470
Jeong-gwon, look!

05:04.554 --> 05:05.555
[Woo-jin exhales]

05:06.222 --> 05:07.223
Here.

05:08.141 --> 05:08.975
Let's sit.

05:09.058 --> 05:11.060
[tranquil music playing]

05:12.395 --> 05:13.479
Thanks for the meal.

05:13.563 --> 05:14.856
-Okay.
-Thanks for the meal.

05:19.402 --> 05:21.696
Gun-woo, don't you
still have to lose some weight?

05:22.739 --> 05:23.573
Hmm.

05:26.367 --> 05:27.827
You think he's going to be okay?

05:27.910 --> 05:30.580
Don't worry about his weight.
It'll quickly fall off him.

05:31.080 --> 05:33.750
-Gun-woo, you'll make the weigh-in?
-Mm.

05:34.334 --> 05:35.168
Hmm.

05:38.963 --> 05:40.757
Gun-woo, keep listening to him.

05:41.382 --> 05:42.258
Mm.

05:42.342 --> 05:44.302
And you, look after him, Woo-jin.

05:44.886 --> 05:45.803
Mm.

05:45.887 --> 05:48.139
-Mm. [chuckles]
-[music fades]

05:48.222 --> 05:49.098
[all chuckle]

05:49.182 --> 05:51.184
-[So-yeon] Mm, mm.
-[all chuckle]

05:51.267 --> 05:52.977
[announcer] Bring the fighters
to the scale

05:53.061 --> 05:56.314
for the WBC World Super-Middleweight
title match.

05:56.397 --> 05:57.231
[man] Yeah!

05:57.315 --> 06:00.860
[announcer] First for the weigh-in,
we have champion, Adik Belov!

06:01.444 --> 06:03.946
Belov has stepped onto the scale
and he's made weight!

06:04.030 --> 06:07.909
Yeah! [grunting]

06:07.992 --> 06:10.620
[announcer] Next we have for the weigh-in,
his opponent, Kim Gun-woo.

06:10.703 --> 06:11.662
[Woo-jin cheers]

06:11.746 --> 06:13.164
[tense music playing]

06:16.918 --> 06:18.961
Kim stands on the scale
and he's made weight.

06:19.045 --> 06:21.714
[cheering, whooping]

06:23.716 --> 06:27.387
In 26 hours, we'll have champion
Adik Belov against Kim Gun-woo

06:27.470 --> 06:28.721
in an exciting match.

06:28.805 --> 06:32.141
Fighters, come to the center of the stage
to face your opponent.

06:35.186 --> 06:37.980
I'm gonna bust your face open!

06:38.064 --> 06:39.899
I kill you!

06:40.400 --> 06:42.276
You are dead tomorrow.

06:49.200 --> 06:51.411
-Hey, are you crazy?!
-[man 3] Break it up!

06:51.494 --> 06:52.787
[man 4] They're fighting.

06:52.870 --> 06:55.456
[man 1] We'd like to remind the staff
to calm the fighters down.

06:55.540 --> 06:57.959
There's no need
for any of this to start now.

06:58.042 --> 07:02.880
[clamoring]

07:17.186 --> 07:19.188
[ominous music playing]

07:29.240 --> 07:30.908
[exhales]

07:53.014 --> 07:55.016
[suspenseful rock music playing]

08:20.166 --> 08:21.042
[music fades]

08:21.125 --> 08:23.377
BLOODHOUNDS 2

08:24.504 --> 08:27.089
We're moments away! I'm Hong Seok-hyeon.

08:27.173 --> 08:31.010
And Kim Kwang-sun, the gold medalist
of the '88 Olympics, is here with me!

08:31.093 --> 08:32.386
Thank you very much. Hello.

08:32.470 --> 08:36.140
Tonight, we'll be watching the WBC
world super middleweight title match

08:36.224 --> 08:37.850
between Adik Belov and Kim Gun-woo.

08:37.934 --> 08:40.311
First, Kim Gun-woo
has made a remarkable rise

08:40.394 --> 08:44.232
since he won the KBFC Rookie
of the Year Tournament five years ago.

08:44.315 --> 08:47.109
Tonight, he's up for the championship
title. Do you think he'll win?

08:47.193 --> 08:48.778
He's risen quickly in the boxing world.

08:48.861 --> 08:51.072
I'm proud of him,
and I think he can do it.

08:51.155 --> 08:53.533
[Seok-hyeon] The fighters have entered.
We're about to begin.

08:53.616 --> 08:58.079
Adik Belov has refused to touch gloves.
This is a power move on Belov's part.

08:58.162 --> 09:01.707
[Kwang-sun] This shows that Belov
is engaging in a psychological war.

09:01.791 --> 09:04.460
[Seok-hyeon] Who knows if that'll pay off?
Fans seem split.

09:04.544 --> 09:09.006
Round one begins, and Adik Belov
again pushes away Kim Gun-woo's glove.

09:09.090 --> 09:11.050
Kim jabs and Belov goes in for the attack.

09:11.133 --> 09:12.802
[Kwang-sun] He's coming on strong.

09:12.885 --> 09:16.597
[Seok-hyeon] Kim punches back, but Belov
aggressively puts Kim into a corner.

09:16.681 --> 09:20.935
Belov's taking control early,
using combinations with speed and power.

09:21.018 --> 09:23.646
-[Kwang-sun] Kim needs to start fighting.
-[Seok-hyeon] That's true.

09:23.729 --> 09:27.024
Belov and Kim square off
as Kim steps forward and starts punching.

09:27.108 --> 09:28.859
A combination of jabs and a right hook.

09:28.943 --> 09:30.653
-Oh!
-[Kwang-sun] Oh!

09:30.736 --> 09:31.821
[high-pitched ringing]

09:31.904 --> 09:33.072
[referee, muffled] Two!

09:34.073 --> 09:35.283
Three!

09:36.534 --> 09:37.785
Four!

09:38.452 --> 09:40.997
[Seok-hyeon] Belov's counter stunned Kim,
knocking him down.

09:41.080 --> 09:44.041
It was as if Kim
was walking right into Belov's plan.

09:44.125 --> 09:45.126
[inaudible speech]

09:45.710 --> 09:46.752
[referee] Six.

09:46.836 --> 09:49.380
[tense music continues]

09:53.009 --> 09:54.051
What happens if Adik wins?

09:54.135 --> 09:56.929
He'll pay you. The prize money
will be used to pay off his debt.

09:57.013 --> 09:59.890
Then why the fuck did I come
if I didn't have to be here?

09:59.974 --> 10:01.392
I'll drag him in no matter what.

10:02.226 --> 10:04.395
Get that bastard in the fucking cage.

10:05.688 --> 10:06.772
Got it.

10:09.650 --> 10:11.861
Win this! You can do it!

10:14.864 --> 10:16.073
It's okay, it's fine.

10:18.242 --> 10:19.910
-Box!
-[Gun-woo exhales]

10:19.994 --> 10:23.164
[Seok-hyeon] Kim Gun-woo's going to be
cautious of Adik Belov's left hook now

10:23.247 --> 10:24.874
because he got caught badly by it.

10:24.957 --> 10:27.918
[Kwang-sun] Kim's an all-around fighter
and he needs to start stepping it up.

10:28.002 --> 10:30.421
-[Seok-hyeon] What a duck!
-[Kwang-sun] Belov being aggressive.

10:30.504 --> 10:32.882
Kim backs away.
He needs to show some combos.

10:32.965 --> 10:36.177
[Seok-hyeon] Can Kim Gun-woo stop
Adik Belov's momentum and find his own?

10:36.260 --> 10:38.262
[Kwang-sun] He got hit in the face again
as he ducks.

10:38.346 --> 10:40.556
[Seok-hyeon] Belov backed Kim Gun-woo
into a corner again.

10:40.640 --> 10:43.100
[Kwang-sun] Belov keeps showing
his finesse in this first round.

10:43.184 --> 10:46.145
The clinch tactic Kim just did
broke it up and was good.

10:46.228 --> 10:48.981
[Seok-hyeon] Kim Gun-woo's
trying to stop Belov's momentum.

10:49.482 --> 10:51.359
[Kwang-sun] Kim's normally
an aggressive fighter,

10:51.442 --> 10:53.027
but he keeps getting pushed back.

10:53.110 --> 10:55.529
[Seok-hyeon] Gun-woo steps back again.
This isn't going well.

10:55.613 --> 10:58.407
[Kwang-sun] It's clear
Kim's taken some damage already.

10:58.491 --> 11:01.869
[Seok-hyeon] Belov hooks left and right,
driving Kim into the corner again.

11:01.952 --> 11:04.455
[Kwang-sun] And Kim backs up
and babysits the corner.

11:04.955 --> 11:08.167
[Seok-hyeon] Right jab, left jab.
Adik keeps attacking!

11:08.668 --> 11:10.252
[Kwang-sun] Kim clinches Adik again.

11:10.336 --> 11:13.547
[Seok-hyeon] Kim's tactic seems to be
to hold off Adik for as long as possible.

11:13.631 --> 11:16.926
[Kwang-sun] First round's over
and Adik Belov clearly dominated.

11:17.009 --> 11:19.720
[Seok-hyeon] Yes.
And that's the end of the first round.

11:22.515 --> 11:24.767
His punches are quick.
His infighting's good.

11:24.850 --> 11:26.977
-[Woo-jin] Catch your breath.
-[Gun-woo panting]

11:27.061 --> 11:28.729
-[Woo-jin] Focus.
-[panting]

11:28.813 --> 11:32.358
[Woo-jin] Don't let him get to you.
Be in his face and don't back down.

11:32.441 --> 11:34.360
You know there's no one alive
who can beat you.

11:35.528 --> 11:36.404
[exhales]

11:36.987 --> 11:37.905
Look at me, man.

11:37.988 --> 11:41.325
[breathes deeply]

11:43.327 --> 11:44.161
Kim Gun-woo.

11:47.623 --> 11:50.334
Trust your infighting.
Trust what we've built.

11:53.170 --> 11:54.630
Eat the competition.

11:54.714 --> 11:56.716
[suspenseful music playing]

11:59.635 --> 12:02.304
Number three's loading.
Calling in the order.

12:03.055 --> 12:04.265
-Ack!
-[yells] Ack!

12:04.348 --> 12:05.391
[grunts] Ack!

12:11.897 --> 12:13.649
-[bell dings]
-[grunts]

12:13.733 --> 12:15.317
[Seok-hyeon] Round two begins.

12:15.818 --> 12:18.279
Kim looks more determined
at the start of this second round.

12:18.779 --> 12:22.116
[Kwang-sun] Kim's being more aggressive.
It's good to see him not back away.

12:22.199 --> 12:25.953
[Seok-hyeon] It's great. Kim gives
well-landed body blows to Belov's side,

12:26.036 --> 12:27.371
followed with quick combos.

12:27.455 --> 12:29.623
[Kwang-sun] It's a great series
of uppercuts and a hook.

12:29.707 --> 12:31.417
[Seok-hyeon] Now, it's Belov retreating.

12:31.500 --> 12:34.295
[Kwang-sun] Kim's fighting
more like his usual style now.

12:34.879 --> 12:37.381
[Seok-hyeon] Kim's displaying
his infighting technique and combos

12:37.465 --> 12:38.340
in this second round.

12:38.424 --> 12:41.927
[Kwang-sun] His coach must've reminded him
who he is and what he's here to do.

12:42.011 --> 12:44.638
He needed to be more aggressive
than he was in the first round.

12:44.722 --> 12:47.433
[Seok-hyeon] Kim mixes up his striking
combos as he closes the distance

12:47.516 --> 12:49.018
with a series to Belov's head and body.

12:49.101 --> 12:51.812
[Kwang-sun] Those punches land quickly
with force and precision.

12:51.896 --> 12:54.732
-[Seok-hyeon] Belov into the corner.
-[Kwang-sun] Things have turned!

12:54.815 --> 12:56.942
-Number three!
-[Seok-hyeon] Kim's got the upper hand.

12:57.026 --> 13:00.905
He delivers a barrage of blows to Belov.
Kim keeps pouring on the punches!

13:00.988 --> 13:03.282
[Kwang-sun] Those were
fast and tight combos.

13:04.492 --> 13:07.286
[Seok-hyeon] Kim lands
a perfect straight punch!

13:07.369 --> 13:09.163
[Kwang-sun] It had power, speed and force.

13:09.246 --> 13:10.998
-[bell rings]
-[Seok-hyeon] What?

13:11.081 --> 13:15.044
I can't believe this. He stopped.
That would've been the finishing blow.

13:15.127 --> 13:16.796
[Kwang-sun] He would've won.
But he stopped.

13:16.879 --> 13:20.174
That punch was going straight to the eye
and would've landed cleanly.

13:20.257 --> 13:21.550
But Kim stopped.

13:21.634 --> 13:24.011
-He stopped it just as the bell rang.
-Yeah.

13:24.094 --> 13:27.348
The sportsmanship tonight.
It shows what kind of athlete Kim is.

13:27.431 --> 13:31.727
[Seok-hyeon] In the second round,
Kim not only showed his commanding skills,

13:31.811 --> 13:33.813
but also his sportsmanship to his fans.

13:33.896 --> 13:36.232
Kim had a great momentum
in the second round.

13:36.315 --> 13:37.900
His fans are on fire.

13:37.983 --> 13:40.903
I'm looking forward to what
we'll see from him in the third round.

13:40.986 --> 13:42.988
[crowd] Kim Gun-woo! Kim Gun-woo!

13:43.072 --> 13:44.240
-This one's yours.
-Yeah?

13:45.199 --> 13:46.951
Belov's got a gash on his left eye.

13:47.034 --> 13:49.328
Finish him off
with your right jab quickly.

13:50.913 --> 13:52.706
[Belov] Stop the blood! How's it looking?

13:52.790 --> 13:53.874
-[Gun-woo] Woo-jin.
-Yeah?

13:54.917 --> 13:56.377
Can't we go with number one?

13:56.460 --> 13:58.379
We're almost finished. Why change?

13:58.462 --> 14:00.339
-I gotta fight!
-[coach] I need you to focus.

14:00.422 --> 14:01.966
-I need to win!
-[coach] Focus!

14:02.049 --> 14:03.843
He'll need a dozen stitches to his face.

14:04.343 --> 14:06.136
I can still win
by using number one instead.

14:06.220 --> 14:07.680
No way. Too risky.

14:07.763 --> 14:08.681
He's the champion.

14:08.764 --> 14:11.600
You've got to stay the course and finish
it off when you have the chance.

14:11.684 --> 14:12.852
[suspenseful music playing]

14:12.935 --> 14:16.981
We should trust the number one.
Trust what we've made and who we are.

14:18.816 --> 14:20.067
[coach] It's just you and me.

14:20.150 --> 14:23.445
He's gonna attack that left eye
with a right hook or a right straight.

14:23.529 --> 14:25.948
Duck it, get in close,
and finish this thing.

14:26.031 --> 14:27.408
-Yeah.
-[coach] Do that for me?

14:28.492 --> 14:29.326
I understand.

14:30.119 --> 14:31.120
[chuckles softly]

14:31.203 --> 14:34.331
So instead, punch him very quickly.

14:34.415 --> 14:36.166
Mm-hmm. Fast.

14:36.876 --> 14:38.460
Like the speed of light!

14:38.544 --> 14:39.837
Lightening!

14:40.462 --> 14:41.839
-[grunts] Ack!
-[grunts] Ack!

14:42.756 --> 14:44.174
-Ack!
-[grunts]

14:44.258 --> 14:45.301
-Go!
-[grunts]

14:46.802 --> 14:47.887
[grunts]

14:47.970 --> 14:49.972
[dramatic music playing]

14:54.727 --> 14:56.395
You'll win this for Uzbekistan, Adik!

15:02.985 --> 15:04.904
[Seok-hyeon] Round three begins.

15:05.571 --> 15:09.700
Kim raises his guard, and he rushes
forward as Adik stays frozen.

15:11.035 --> 15:14.288
Kim lands a left hook onto Adik's side!

15:14.914 --> 15:17.666
[Kwang-sun] It went clean
on the right side of Adik's body.

15:17.750 --> 15:21.378
[Seok-hyeon] Wow, Belov quickly collapses.
Will he be able to get up?

15:21.462 --> 15:24.465
-You can do it! Come on!
-[Kwang-sun] Didn't take that punch well.

15:24.548 --> 15:27.134
[Seok-hyeon] Belov's still
down on the ground, in pain.

15:27.217 --> 15:30.387
Belov took some heavy damage!
Is this the end?

15:30.971 --> 15:32.806
-Nine.
-[Seok-hyeon] We're at the count of nine.

15:32.890 --> 15:35.476
-The match has been called!
-[cheering]

15:35.559 --> 15:36.727
It's over!

15:36.810 --> 15:38.896
[Kwang-sun] Kim gave a fight-ending KO.

15:38.979 --> 15:42.608
[Seok-hyeon] Kim Gun-woo is the new
WBC super middleweight champion!

15:43.192 --> 15:49.865
[crowd] Kim Gun-woo! Kim Gun-woo!
Kim Gun-woo! Kim Gun-woo!

15:50.699 --> 15:51.659
[Gun-woo] Are you okay?

15:52.159 --> 15:57.665
[crowd] Kim Gun-woo! Kim Gun-woo!
Kim Gun-woo! Kim Gun-woo!

15:57.748 --> 16:00.709
You're a good fighter. Forget what I said.

16:00.793 --> 16:02.252
It's just business.

16:03.879 --> 16:04.713
Thank you.

16:10.135 --> 16:12.972
[rock music playing]

16:13.806 --> 16:15.349
[Woo-jin yells]

16:15.432 --> 16:18.727
[both yell]

16:18.811 --> 16:20.771
[screams happily]

16:20.854 --> 16:25.693
[all yell happily]

16:25.776 --> 16:28.445
-[music fades]
-[Woo-jin] Gun-woo, see what I got. Look.

16:30.906 --> 16:33.200
[Woo-jin coughing]

16:34.994 --> 16:36.912
Gross. Why do people smoke this?

16:36.996 --> 16:37.871
Throw it out.

16:37.955 --> 16:41.208
-No way. This… [coughs] …cost 100,000 won.
-It did?

16:41.291 --> 16:42.209
But I'll throw it.

16:42.292 --> 16:43.711
I'll throw it away.

16:43.794 --> 16:45.546
Done. It was nice.

16:46.255 --> 16:47.131
Having the cigar.

16:47.715 --> 16:49.133
You just wasted money though.

16:49.216 --> 16:52.511
[exhales] Hey, we used to be so broke

16:53.012 --> 16:55.556
we could barely afford the buffets.

16:55.639 --> 16:57.599
Now, we throw cigars away.

16:58.183 --> 17:00.728
And now you're the champion. The winner!

17:00.811 --> 17:01.812
[both laugh]

17:01.895 --> 17:02.938
For real. [chuckles]

17:03.022 --> 17:04.523
[chuckles]

17:07.818 --> 17:09.945
It feels like yesterday
we took down Kim Myeong-gil.

17:10.988 --> 17:12.740
It's gone by so quickly.

17:15.701 --> 17:16.994
[exhales]

17:18.579 --> 17:19.413
What now?

17:20.914 --> 17:21.832
Woo-jin,

17:22.750 --> 17:25.711
should we go visit Mr. Choi's grave
with the championship belt?

17:25.794 --> 17:27.796
[poignant music playing]

17:28.338 --> 17:30.424
Geez, you've grown up.
Not like your coach.

17:31.300 --> 17:33.010
-I know.
-What?

17:33.594 --> 17:34.678
I'm just playing!

17:34.762 --> 17:35.888
[both laugh]

17:35.971 --> 17:38.557
You've grown so much now
you even know how to joke around.

17:38.640 --> 17:41.518
-I learned that from you.
-[both chuckle]

17:43.479 --> 17:45.355
Do you know why I'm grateful to you?

17:45.856 --> 17:48.108
-Huh?
-Im, the loan shark.

17:48.192 --> 17:51.820
When we went to borrow money
from that guy, he said he'd lend it

17:52.946 --> 17:54.656
if we became bloodhounds.

17:54.740 --> 17:56.116
That was his stipulation.

17:56.784 --> 17:59.036
[Im] Here's a first-tier loan
of 100 million.

17:59.536 --> 18:01.914
In exchange, you'll do some work for me.

18:04.625 --> 18:07.711
I would probably
be beating people up for money…

18:10.422 --> 18:13.258
if you hadn't told me to leave
when he asked us.

18:14.635 --> 18:15.803
It's thanks to you, Gun-woo,

18:17.387 --> 18:19.181
that this belt's here, with us.

18:19.932 --> 18:20.974
[Gun-woo] No, not at all.

18:22.309 --> 18:23.644
You're the reason.

18:24.228 --> 18:25.729
You're why we're here now.

18:27.439 --> 18:30.984
Without you, we wouldn't have been able
to take down Kim Myeong-gil.

18:31.819 --> 18:32.945
And also,

18:33.779 --> 18:37.199
I wouldn't have been able to make it
this far. Not if I stayed with Coach Kim.

18:39.409 --> 18:42.037
It's all because of you that we're here,

18:42.538 --> 18:44.456
and as champions of the world.

18:45.457 --> 18:48.210
Retiring as a boxer
and working as your coach

18:50.129 --> 18:51.839
was the only decision

18:52.339 --> 18:54.466
I could have done to change our lives.

18:55.884 --> 18:58.554
But we're not stopping here.
We're going onwards.

18:59.054 --> 19:01.306
Let's be the champions of the universe.

19:01.849 --> 19:02.850
[exhales]

19:03.475 --> 19:04.977
Until we die together,

19:05.853 --> 19:07.312
we'll say, "Ack!" together.

19:10.607 --> 19:12.276
-Ack!
-Ack!

19:12.359 --> 19:13.485
Ack!

19:13.569 --> 19:14.611
[laughs]

19:15.320 --> 19:16.321
Time to turn them.

19:16.405 --> 19:18.615
No, they got
30 more seconds of cooking left.

19:18.699 --> 19:20.868
-Oh, just do it.
-No way.

19:20.951 --> 19:22.411
It's time. Just try.

19:22.995 --> 19:24.204
[sighs]

19:25.122 --> 19:25.956
Huh?

19:26.832 --> 19:27.833
Well, what's this?

19:27.916 --> 19:30.544
I put more charcoal
when you weren't looking.

19:30.627 --> 19:31.545
[So-yeon laughs]

19:32.629 --> 19:35.090
-[Gun-woo] When did you do that?
-[laughs]

19:38.677 --> 19:39.761
[music fades]

19:50.898 --> 19:51.982
-Thank you.
-[man] Of course.

19:52.065 --> 19:52.900
It's good.

19:54.484 --> 19:55.485
[car door closes]

20:00.365 --> 20:01.992
-[Min-beom] Grab two blue ones.
-[man] Yes.

20:02.492 --> 20:04.411
[poignant music playing]

20:04.494 --> 20:06.330
-[Woo-jin] Hmm.
-[Gun-woo] Mmm.

20:06.413 --> 20:08.165
-Let's have the neck meat now.
-[Gun-woo] Mm.

20:11.460 --> 20:14.755
-Oh my! Well, hello. Good to see you.
-Good evening, Ms. Yoon. Congratulations.

20:14.838 --> 20:15.839
Hello, Ms. Yoon.

20:15.923 --> 20:17.633
I'm sorry to bother you this evening.

20:17.716 --> 20:20.844
Oh, no, no, you're always welcome.
Come in! [chuckles nervously]

20:20.928 --> 20:22.262
I was on a business trip.

20:22.346 --> 20:25.766
I went to Taiwan and I thought of you,
so I got you a little gift.

20:25.849 --> 20:28.644
-I hope you don't mind.
-Really? You shouldn't have. [gasps]

20:28.727 --> 20:30.020
Oh, it's so generous.

20:30.103 --> 20:31.355
Thank you so much.

20:31.438 --> 20:33.565
It's something small,
so accept it without obligation.

20:33.649 --> 20:34.483
Oh, jeez.

20:34.566 --> 20:36.443
You always make delicious food
when I come here.

20:36.526 --> 20:40.072
Oh my, you're always welcome here.
Don't just stand there.

20:40.155 --> 20:41.406
-Thanks.
-[gasps]

20:43.283 --> 20:46.370
-Gun-woo, Woo-jin! Min-beom's here.
-Oh! Oh.

20:47.621 --> 20:48.622
Congratulations!

20:49.581 --> 20:51.083
-[Min-beom chuckles]
-Look what I have!

20:51.166 --> 20:53.460
-Oh, the belt! Wow, nice.
-It's big.

20:53.961 --> 20:56.296
I wanted to be there,
but my trip got extended.

20:56.380 --> 20:57.965
-I'm sorry.
-[Gun-woo] I understand.

20:58.048 --> 21:00.717
He clobbered his opponent in three rounds.
It finished quickly.

21:00.801 --> 21:02.219
That fast?

21:02.302 --> 21:03.136
[music stops]

21:03.220 --> 21:04.972
I've got good news myself.

21:05.055 --> 21:06.431
-Let's have a drink?
-Sounds good.

21:06.515 --> 21:07.557
Great. [chuckles]

21:08.767 --> 21:10.852
-[Min-beom] Well done, you two.
-[all] Cheers!

21:10.936 --> 21:12.771
[upbeat music playing]

21:14.231 --> 21:16.191
-[Min-beom] Drink all that at once?
-[exhales]

21:19.111 --> 21:20.195
[meat sizzles]

21:20.279 --> 21:21.613
[Min-beom] Cheers!

21:25.450 --> 21:26.785
[chuckles]

21:29.579 --> 21:30.747
[gasps happily]

21:33.834 --> 21:35.127
[Min-beom] Cheers!

21:40.132 --> 21:41.425
[blows] Ha.

21:41.508 --> 21:42.801
Mmm!

21:46.054 --> 21:47.472
[sighs]

21:47.556 --> 21:49.224
IIL SEOUL HOSPITAL
AERIAL RENDERING

21:49.308 --> 21:50.267
[music fades]

21:50.350 --> 21:51.310
Whoa.

21:51.393 --> 21:53.312
My new approved project.

21:53.395 --> 21:56.481
It's four floors underground,
ten floors above ground.

21:56.565 --> 21:58.400
When our nonprofit grows more,

21:58.483 --> 22:01.403
this is where I'll build
the pediatric hospital.

22:01.486 --> 22:02.863
Once we build that,

22:03.363 --> 22:04.990
we'll name the hospital

22:05.657 --> 22:08.368
Tae-ho Pediatric Clinic, after Mr. Choi.

22:10.162 --> 22:11.371
[poignant music playing]

22:11.455 --> 22:13.498
That's so freaking cool.

22:14.499 --> 22:16.209
I know. [laughs]

22:16.293 --> 22:20.088
[all laugh]

22:21.089 --> 22:23.592
Min-beom, Gun-woo,

22:24.384 --> 22:27.846
let's all raise our glasses
for those who aren't here.

22:28.347 --> 22:29.514
Friends in heaven?

22:29.598 --> 22:30.766
Let's say,

22:31.850 --> 22:32.893
"Thanks for everything."

22:34.144 --> 22:36.646
Yes. Mm.

22:37.230 --> 22:39.566
[all] Thanks for everything.

22:44.446 --> 22:45.739
[exhales]

22:45.822 --> 22:47.991
[Min-beom] Yes, thank you.

22:49.076 --> 22:51.078
[ominous music playing]

22:59.836 --> 23:00.921
Where are we going?

23:02.422 --> 23:03.590
You will fight

23:03.673 --> 23:04.966
to pay your debt.

23:07.010 --> 23:07.844
Look at this.

23:08.929 --> 23:10.430
Let's do it tomorrow.

23:11.431 --> 23:15.685
Tomorrow, there will be
a million-dollar interest.

23:16.186 --> 23:17.646
Ah, fuck!

23:18.814 --> 23:20.107
[laughs]

23:26.238 --> 23:28.115
[tense music playing]

23:35.914 --> 23:36.748
Take Adik.

23:42.129 --> 23:43.588
The fighter's here.

23:51.721 --> 23:52.848
[tense music builds]

24:09.698 --> 24:10.949
Hey.

24:14.453 --> 24:15.454
Put them in.

24:16.121 --> 24:16.955
For real?

24:18.123 --> 24:19.749
I can kill someone.

24:19.833 --> 24:21.376
It happens.

24:21.460 --> 24:22.419
[exhales]

24:23.170 --> 24:25.172
-[clattering]
-That's fucked up, man.

24:26.923 --> 24:28.049
-[sighs]
-[knife clicks]

24:30.093 --> 24:34.514
You losing over $3 million
in two hours in a poker game is fucked up.

24:35.015 --> 24:37.851
We know where your daughter lives.

24:38.643 --> 24:39.686
That's fucked up.

24:43.482 --> 24:44.441
Pick that up.

24:52.282 --> 24:55.243
Welcome to
the Iron Knuckle Fighting Championship.

25:00.081 --> 25:02.459
[breathes deeply]

25:17.474 --> 25:18.433
[chuckles]

25:18.934 --> 25:20.936
[suspenseful music playing]

25:24.981 --> 25:27.692
[man] Go in. You two, wait over there.

25:30.946 --> 25:32.072
Okay, let's go, LOL.

25:32.572 --> 25:36.826
At last, the undisputed
WBC super middleweight champion,

25:36.910 --> 25:40.413
Adik Belov, just showed up at IKFC36.

25:40.497 --> 25:43.250
The showdown between the Hunter
and Bulldozer's about to begin!

25:43.333 --> 25:47.879
So better get the bets ready
'cause we're about to go down!

25:47.963 --> 25:49.965
[rock music playing]

25:51.883 --> 25:52.884
[music fades]

25:53.593 --> 25:54.970
[man] We've passed 300 million.

25:55.053 --> 25:58.890
We've now gone past 400 million.
Our commission will be 12 million.

25:59.432 --> 26:02.435
-How much is my amount?
-Well, more than if you were sleeping.

26:03.478 --> 26:06.189
Say exactly how much, motherfucker.

26:06.273 --> 26:08.275
[tense music playing]

26:08.775 --> 26:11.069
At least, maybe,
three times more than before.

26:17.409 --> 26:19.494
-[music fades]
-[exhales sharply]

26:23.748 --> 26:25.750
[suspenseful music playing]

26:46.229 --> 26:47.856
You motherfucker.

26:48.607 --> 26:51.234
I needed to ask for more money.

26:51.318 --> 26:54.362
'Cause you're too fucking easy!

26:58.575 --> 26:59.909
Let's start this.

27:00.619 --> 27:01.578
[music stops]

27:01.661 --> 27:03.079
Let's fight!

27:05.498 --> 27:06.416
[grunts]

27:07.709 --> 27:10.795
[both huffing]

27:11.504 --> 27:13.298
[both grunting]

27:28.605 --> 27:30.065
[tense music playing]

27:38.948 --> 27:40.700
[heaving]

27:40.784 --> 27:42.077
[men grunt]

27:42.160 --> 27:42.994
-Ah!
-[grunting]

27:43.078 --> 27:44.788
[groaning]

27:45.413 --> 27:47.707
[both grunting]

27:52.128 --> 27:53.171
[yells in pain]

27:54.297 --> 27:55.965
[groans]

27:56.675 --> 27:57.801
[Belov groans]

27:59.678 --> 28:00.762
Destroying Adik now.

28:00.845 --> 28:04.140
Oh, shit. Look at Adik's face!

28:04.224 --> 28:06.142
-He's bitching! [laughs]
-[laughs]

28:06.226 --> 28:07.686
[fighters grunting]

28:07.769 --> 28:08.687
[bones crack]

28:17.612 --> 28:18.697
[music fades]

28:18.780 --> 28:25.495
[panting heavily]

28:25.578 --> 28:26.788
Cameras off.

28:27.706 --> 28:28.748
[tense music playing]

28:28.832 --> 28:29.916
Cameras off now.

28:41.094 --> 28:47.767
-[wet blows thudding]
-[blood splattering]

28:59.237 --> 29:00.363
[exhales]

29:01.906 --> 29:03.074
How much did I make?

29:03.158 --> 29:05.034
Twelve times more than before.

29:19.299 --> 29:20.717
Bring me the one who beat the idiot.

29:21.342 --> 29:22.427
[man] Okay, will do.

29:27.515 --> 29:28.391
[music fades]

29:28.475 --> 29:30.518
Did you find anything useful there?

29:33.813 --> 29:35.482
I'm able to hear a pulse.

29:35.982 --> 29:37.358
I think I can get some things.

29:37.442 --> 29:38.818
What about his heart?

29:39.319 --> 29:42.572
His heartbeat sounds good.
It must be because he's a fighter.

29:42.655 --> 29:43.490
How much can I get?

29:43.573 --> 29:47.285
Fifty million won for the heart.
Double that for the kidneys.

29:48.077 --> 29:48.953
That sounds very good.

29:49.037 --> 29:51.331
-[man] Move over.
-[ominous music playing]

29:51.915 --> 29:54.542
-[knife slices]
-[blood burbles]

29:57.796 --> 30:01.132
[man in white coat] Hey.
How can I sell him if you kill him? Hey!

30:01.633 --> 30:03.092
[tense music playing]

30:04.427 --> 30:05.637
[man sighs]

30:06.429 --> 30:08.765
We're not gonna sell body parts this way.

30:09.516 --> 30:10.892
It'll leave evidence.

30:13.436 --> 30:16.272
He wants his next fighter.
It'll be Kim Gun-woo.

30:28.368 --> 30:29.285
[music fades]

30:29.369 --> 30:30.995
Two, three.

30:31.079 --> 30:32.580
[gentle piano music playing]

30:33.164 --> 30:35.500
-Have you been exercising?
-Yes.

30:36.000 --> 30:37.502
Okay, that's awesome.

30:38.002 --> 30:40.255
Try it on your own without my help.

30:40.338 --> 30:42.465
You're going to straighten your fingers.

30:42.549 --> 30:44.133
A little bit more. Keep trying.

30:44.217 --> 30:46.302
You're doing it.
Put more strength into it.

30:46.386 --> 30:48.930
-You're doing great. A bit more.
-[Tae-yeong breathes heavily]

30:49.013 --> 30:52.225
-[physiotherapist] Keep trying. Very good.
-[breathes heavily]

30:52.308 --> 30:54.561
-The kimchi's in there?
-Yeah. I put it right there.

30:54.644 --> 30:56.020
Good, I see it. Yeah.

30:56.521 --> 30:58.481
Try to straighten your fingers
all the way.

30:58.565 --> 31:01.109
Good. A little bit more.
You're doing well.

31:01.985 --> 31:03.361
Just a little bit more.

31:03.862 --> 31:06.614
-How about a little straighter?
-[breathes heavily]

31:09.117 --> 31:12.453
[physiotherapist] Do it with two fingers
at a time, starting with these two.

31:14.956 --> 31:18.334
Straighten them.
Let's see if you can do it all the way.

31:18.418 --> 31:19.627
A little bit straighter.

31:19.711 --> 31:21.713
-[music stops]
-Have a good rest of your day.

31:21.796 --> 31:23.423
-She's coming.
-[Tae-yeong] Thank you.

31:24.299 --> 31:27.302
Hey. [chuckles]
Congrats on winning the championship.

31:27.385 --> 31:28.595
[Gun-woo] Thank you.

31:28.678 --> 31:31.014
Today, we brought you… jangjorim.

31:31.097 --> 31:32.640
Gun-woo's mom packed a lot.

31:32.724 --> 31:36.561
Perfect, I finished up
all of my other food. I'll enjoy this.

31:37.061 --> 31:38.104
[Woo-jin] Ready to go?

31:38.688 --> 31:41.399
-Let's go to the supermarket now?
-Great.

31:42.650 --> 31:43.818
[Tae-yeong clears throat]

31:44.319 --> 31:46.905
-[Woo-jin] The button. For the elevator.
-[Gun-woo] Right, sorry.

31:46.988 --> 31:49.782
[Tae-yeong] President Hong
has been asking me to work for him.

31:49.866 --> 31:51.784
He knows my hands
aren't as fast as before,

31:51.868 --> 31:53.244
but I can still do the work.

31:53.328 --> 31:54.412
[Woo-jin] Oh.

31:54.495 --> 31:58.166
He said, next month, I can start on
the ninth floor of the Iil Group building.

31:58.249 --> 31:59.417
-Oh.
-Oh.

31:59.918 --> 32:02.086
Is the work similar
to what you did for the police?

32:02.170 --> 32:05.089
I tracked for the
Cyber Investigation Unit. Cyber crimes.

32:05.173 --> 32:09.010
My work at Iil Group is to protect
and secure their information network

32:09.093 --> 32:12.096
from viruses
and potential computer crackers.

32:12.180 --> 32:14.182
Oh, crackers.

32:14.891 --> 32:16.059
What are crackers?

32:16.142 --> 32:18.353
You get sick from them. It's bad.

32:18.853 --> 32:19.896
-Oh.
-[Tae-yeong laughs]

32:20.396 --> 32:22.357
They're hackers with no good intent.

32:22.440 --> 32:23.608
-Hmm.
-So bad hackers.

32:23.691 --> 32:24.525
Hmm.

32:25.318 --> 32:28.404
Oh, did we
go by the toilet paper aisle already?

32:28.488 --> 32:30.531
-Looks like we did. I'll get it.
-See you soon.

32:30.615 --> 32:31.658
[Gun-woo] Okay.

32:33.159 --> 32:36.913
Woo-jin, could I talk to you
about something for a second?

32:36.996 --> 32:38.164
I'm all ears.

32:38.247 --> 32:39.165
[Tae-yeong chuckles]

32:40.291 --> 32:41.584
-So?
-[Tae-yeong chuckles]

32:42.168 --> 32:46.297
I really appreciate how you guys
help me like this every week.

32:46.798 --> 32:48.967
It's just, well,

32:49.926 --> 32:51.469
you really don't have to,

32:51.552 --> 32:54.806
because there's no need
for you to feel guilty about me at all.

32:54.889 --> 32:59.560
I was on duty as a police officer.
It wasn't anyone's fault I got this hurt.

33:01.104 --> 33:04.524
I'm fine to do things on my own now.
[laughs awkwardly]

33:04.607 --> 33:06.609
[poignant music playing]

33:07.151 --> 33:08.194
Dear Tae-yeong,

33:08.820 --> 33:10.822
we've never told you this before.

33:11.531 --> 33:14.283
Gun-woo and I have a rule
we created together.

33:15.451 --> 33:16.869
And what rule is that?

33:17.912 --> 33:19.330
Once you become family,

33:19.414 --> 33:21.082
you'll always be family.

33:22.500 --> 33:23.459
We protect our family

33:24.460 --> 33:26.004
with our lives to the end.

33:26.087 --> 33:27.422
Together, for real.

33:32.135 --> 33:33.469
It goes without saying,

33:33.970 --> 33:35.596
Tae-yeong is

33:36.472 --> 33:37.807
with us forever.

33:46.065 --> 33:47.066
[Tae-yeong sniffles]

33:49.027 --> 33:50.987
I… I'm sorry. [sniffles]

33:52.405 --> 33:54.115
You can call us.

33:55.616 --> 33:57.452
We're here for you always.

33:58.619 --> 34:00.079
We're the Marine duo.

34:00.663 --> 34:02.206
We're at your service.

34:03.833 --> 34:06.169
-Dear Tae-yeong.
-[chuckles] I will.

34:06.252 --> 34:07.754
-[Tae-yeong sniffles]
-Ack.

34:11.299 --> 34:12.508
[cries]

34:12.592 --> 34:14.218
[sighs] Tae-yeong.

34:16.304 --> 34:19.807
[Tae-yeong cries]

34:19.891 --> 34:21.142
[Woo-jin] Huggies.

34:21.225 --> 34:23.019
[Tae-yeong crying]

34:24.020 --> 34:25.271
[sighs]

34:29.275 --> 34:30.568
[music fades]

34:32.653 --> 34:33.946
They're dating! [gasps]

34:35.364 --> 34:37.366
[giggles]

34:39.869 --> 34:41.871
[ominous music playing]

35:02.642 --> 35:03.684
[music fades]

35:05.019 --> 35:07.188
[doorbell chimes]

35:11.526 --> 35:12.652
Yes, who is it?

35:12.735 --> 35:14.529
Good evening. We're friends of Gun-woo's.

35:14.612 --> 35:18.616
I see. Well, Gun-woo isn't home
and he may return late.

35:18.699 --> 35:22.453
Oh, we're supposed to see each other.
I might have come early.

35:23.037 --> 35:25.331
Would it be okay if we waited inside?

35:25.414 --> 35:26.707
[ominous music resumes]

35:26.791 --> 35:28.918
We're friends because
we go to the same gym.

35:29.001 --> 35:29.961
I see.

35:30.545 --> 35:33.339
We were at the same match
where he won the title.

35:33.840 --> 35:35.591
It's too bad we didn't say hi.

35:36.217 --> 35:39.011
Is it okay if we wait inside?
Because it's cold?

35:41.472 --> 35:43.975
Oh, well, sure.
Hold on while I let you in.

36:09.458 --> 36:11.752
[device whirring]

36:13.462 --> 36:14.380
[music fades]

36:19.594 --> 36:20.636
That was fun.

36:22.221 --> 36:23.306
[door closes]

36:24.473 --> 36:25.391
[gasps]

36:26.142 --> 36:27.059
[So-yeon] You're home.

36:29.228 --> 36:30.897
-[Woo-jin] Mom, go upstairs.
-[So-yeon] Why?

36:30.980 --> 36:32.648
[Woo-jin] Please wait upstairs.

36:32.732 --> 36:34.734
[ominous music playing]

36:40.615 --> 36:42.950
Don't bother being brave. Take a seat.

36:45.369 --> 36:46.787
I said sit.

36:48.080 --> 36:49.874
Sit down and let's talk.

36:50.374 --> 36:51.584
Who are you?

36:51.667 --> 36:54.629
I'm running a boxing corporation
called the IKFC.

36:55.213 --> 36:57.757
I want you. You should join my league.

37:00.885 --> 37:02.345
I know nothing about this league.

37:02.428 --> 37:04.931
You wouldn't know
because it's very private.

37:05.014 --> 37:08.142
Private and successful, with a membership
of four million worldwide.

37:09.185 --> 37:11.437
You'd be a great addition to my roster.

37:11.520 --> 37:13.564
Sounds like made-up nonsense.

37:14.232 --> 37:15.149
IKFC?

37:15.775 --> 37:19.111
It's a chicken place?
We don't do fights with chickens.

37:22.698 --> 37:23.783
[exhales]

37:25.576 --> 37:28.579
What did you make fighting Adik?
Hundred million?

37:28.663 --> 37:29.914
Two hundred million won?

37:32.375 --> 37:35.002
In IKFC, one match
will pay you ten billion.

37:35.086 --> 37:36.295
Ten billion won.

37:41.133 --> 37:42.510
A billion just to accept.

37:49.350 --> 37:51.352
[man 1 sighs] Gun-woo,

37:52.061 --> 37:54.772
if you get hurt boxing,
you'll be a cripple for life.

37:55.856 --> 37:57.733
I know too many guys who got fucked.

37:58.734 --> 38:01.028
Make the dough while you can. Hmm?

38:01.696 --> 38:02.613
[exhales]

38:03.114 --> 38:07.493
Just fight one match. The upcoming event.
Your money worries will disappear.

38:12.081 --> 38:14.125
With that much fucking money,

38:14.917 --> 38:16.794
who in your family
would even have to work?

38:17.295 --> 38:18.587
You would take care of everybody.

38:18.671 --> 38:19.547
[sighs]

38:24.135 --> 38:25.261
[man 1] It's just one match.

38:29.181 --> 38:31.934
[sighing] For fuck's sake.

38:32.893 --> 38:33.936
[man 1 exhales]

38:34.020 --> 38:35.062
Hey,

38:36.063 --> 38:38.649
an extra five billion if you win? Hmm?

38:42.903 --> 38:44.488
Fifteen billion won?

38:45.114 --> 38:46.657
[scurried footsteps approach]

38:47.366 --> 38:48.284
[Gun-woo] Mom.

38:51.370 --> 38:53.039
Who wants that much money?

38:54.540 --> 38:57.626
They said they were your friends
from the gym. That's why I let them in.

38:58.127 --> 39:01.339
What kind of people who lie so easily
have money that's clean?

39:02.048 --> 39:04.508
Dirty money always comes
with a price, Gun-woo.

39:13.476 --> 39:15.144
You have to go now and leave our house.

39:15.227 --> 39:16.604
Hey, ma'am,

39:17.605 --> 39:18.647
shut your fucking mouth.

39:18.731 --> 39:21.359
[Woo-jin] You need to take your money
and fuck off!

39:21.442 --> 39:22.526
Sir.

39:24.362 --> 39:26.405
Remember, we came here for a reason.

39:30.868 --> 39:31.911
Let's go now.

39:31.994 --> 39:32.870
Go fuck yourself.

39:33.829 --> 39:34.663
[man 2] Shut up.

39:37.124 --> 39:39.668
Shut up and fucking stay still. Got it?

39:39.752 --> 39:41.754
[tense music playing]

39:56.936 --> 39:59.313
Everyone always gives me what I want.

40:02.775 --> 40:04.819
You and I are gonna fight together.

40:08.280 --> 40:09.240
See you around.

40:09.323 --> 40:10.199
[music fades]

40:20.167 --> 40:21.794
We're fine. It's okay.

40:23.045 --> 40:26.799
[So-yeon breathes shakily]

40:33.722 --> 40:35.474
You'll bring me his fucking mom.

40:35.558 --> 40:37.059
[sinister music playing]

40:40.146 --> 40:41.105
[car door closes]

40:41.188 --> 40:42.773
If the payment's upfront.

40:44.275 --> 40:45.359
-[exhales]
-[music fades]

40:45.943 --> 40:48.946
They'll come back here for sure.
We'll be ready for them.

40:49.447 --> 40:51.907
We'll be ready so we can destroy them
when they return.

40:51.991 --> 40:53.993
[tense music playing]

40:55.703 --> 40:59.081
Woo-jin… are you still in touch
with Yang Jae-myeong?

41:01.041 --> 41:04.253
That asshole knew the world of boxing.
Let's ask Yang Jae-myeong.

41:04.336 --> 41:05.421
Mm.

41:09.800 --> 41:11.343
DIRT-DIGGER YANG

41:18.142 --> 41:21.604
Well, well, well,
it's been too long, hasn't it? [laughs]

41:22.104 --> 41:23.272
Long time no see.

41:23.898 --> 41:28.944
You ask and I give, again. I got you
all, all, all the information. [laughs]

41:44.001 --> 41:45.669
[Jae-myeong] What? It's not there? Really?

41:45.753 --> 41:46.837
No, it's not.

41:47.338 --> 41:50.382
These come directly
from the Korean Boxing Association.

41:50.466 --> 41:53.469
They fit the weight class and description
you gave, so that's that.

41:53.552 --> 41:57.014
Could you check one weight class below?
Maybe his weight has changed.

41:57.097 --> 41:59.683
Oh, you're right. That's the answer.

42:00.184 --> 42:02.228
Give me a little longer
and that info's all yours.

42:02.311 --> 42:06.190
Oh, and also, do you have information
on this group, IKFC?

42:06.273 --> 42:10.152
I called the illegal fight clubs and
no one has heard anything about IKFC.

42:10.236 --> 42:13.614
It might not be in Korea.
Maybe they're located abroad?

42:14.114 --> 42:16.492
If you consider the name,
it sounds international.

42:16.575 --> 42:19.495
Worldwide. They did say
they have four million members.

42:19.578 --> 42:21.872
That many? Whoa, four million?

42:22.873 --> 42:25.543
The stakes must be so big
with that many millions in the group.

42:25.626 --> 42:27.920
Please explain what exactly that means.

42:28.003 --> 42:29.880
Well, think about it.
That's four million people.

42:29.964 --> 42:32.258
If they each put ten thousand won in,
how much will that be?

42:32.341 --> 42:36.845
Forty billion won, that's how much.
Right? The fees must be outrageous too.

42:38.847 --> 42:39.848
Thanks very much.

42:39.932 --> 42:40.891
[music stops]

42:43.727 --> 42:45.104
[somber music playing]

42:45.187 --> 42:46.564
-Gun-woo.
-[Gun-woo] Yes?

42:47.064 --> 42:50.734
[Woo-jin] We might need help.
We should ask the guys for it.

42:51.527 --> 42:52.403
[Gun-woo] Like who?

42:53.153 --> 42:56.782
Min-beom. Gang-yong.
Moon Gwang-mu. Everyone.

43:00.286 --> 43:03.038
I don't want any of them to get hurt
because of me, Woo-jin.

43:03.914 --> 43:04.915
[sighs]

43:05.583 --> 43:09.211
Yeah, it hurts me, too, and I feel guilty.
Especially about Tae-yeong.

43:09.295 --> 43:11.714
Then we'll do it together,
just the two of us.

43:12.339 --> 43:14.008
We took Kim Myeong-gil down on our own.

43:14.091 --> 43:17.970
We got him because we had help.
The other guys were there with us.

43:19.096 --> 43:21.432
Mm. Yes, we had help then.

43:22.516 --> 43:23.350
But

43:24.768 --> 43:27.187
can't we just try
to do it on our own this time?

43:31.317 --> 43:32.151
Hmm?

43:38.824 --> 43:39.950
[music fades]

43:41.785 --> 43:44.997
I've been thinking
about how we can kidnap Gun-woo's mother.

43:47.124 --> 43:48.959
[sinister music playing]

43:49.043 --> 43:52.171
The four of them
are serving life sentences in prison.

43:52.254 --> 43:53.380
They all would be good.

43:53.464 --> 43:56.300
They've got a grudge against Kim Gun-woo
and his friend, Hong Woo-jin.

43:56.800 --> 43:58.594
If we can get them out of prison,

43:59.261 --> 44:02.014
we'll get relentless bloodhounds
that will never give up.

44:02.097 --> 44:03.474
Can we control them?

44:05.267 --> 44:06.518
I see why you're concerned.

44:06.602 --> 44:09.104
They won't have any choice
but to rely on us

44:09.188 --> 44:11.273
since they'll be wanted criminals.

44:11.357 --> 44:13.108
And if they help us get the job done,

44:14.109 --> 44:17.446
I'll throw a carrot and offer to help them
to escape to somewhere abroad.

44:17.529 --> 44:18.906
How much does that cost?

44:19.823 --> 44:22.284
100 million won. For each person.

44:25.829 --> 44:28.707
[sighs] Shitface.
That's fucking expensive.

44:28.791 --> 44:31.710
The profit's going to be
more than ten times the cost.

44:31.794 --> 44:33.629
You're full of shit.

44:37.508 --> 44:40.094
[sinister music builds]

44:52.314 --> 44:53.232
This one.

44:54.733 --> 44:56.318
The one I would've picked.

44:56.819 --> 45:01.532
There's a security company I always use
whenever I have VIPs visiting from abroad.

45:01.615 --> 45:03.784
The founders are
former presidential security agents,

45:03.867 --> 45:05.411
which means they're thorough.

45:05.494 --> 45:08.455
But recently, their sales director
and their CEO had a falling out.

45:08.539 --> 45:12.751
By default, their hired hands
haven't been paid for a very long time.

45:14.002 --> 45:14.878
So what?

45:14.962 --> 45:17.881
There's a small risk
of things not going our way.

45:17.965 --> 45:21.093
Well, especially because gangsters
and ex-cons are rough.

45:21.593 --> 45:24.513
So in case Ms. Yoon gets hurt,
things could get really messy,

45:24.596 --> 45:26.348
which isn't what we want.

45:26.849 --> 45:29.476
So I recommend we use them,

45:29.560 --> 45:31.520
even if it costs a little more extra.

45:33.063 --> 45:37.693
[sighs] Shit, another way
to get extra funds? Just handle it.

45:40.279 --> 45:43.782
During jobs like these there are
all sorts of variables that might happen.

45:44.366 --> 45:48.912
That's why… you should
go with a bloodhound who has our back.

45:49.413 --> 45:51.874
That's a golden rule when I'm working.

46:01.842 --> 46:02.843
No mistakes.

46:02.926 --> 46:03.844
[music fades]

46:04.845 --> 46:06.388
Thanks for the payment.

46:12.728 --> 46:13.604
Hmm.

46:14.396 --> 46:15.856
Will you get these for me?

46:17.608 --> 46:20.444
GASOLINE, DDNP, SALTPETER
NICHROME, DETONATOR, CELL PHONE

46:20.527 --> 46:21.653
[chuckles]

46:23.697 --> 46:26.325
There's no reason
to go this far, Sergeant Yun.

46:26.408 --> 46:28.869
I need to be ready, Mr. Lee.

46:28.952 --> 46:30.037
[chuckles]

46:31.121 --> 46:32.039
Well,

46:33.165 --> 46:34.249
trust what I do.

46:34.333 --> 46:36.084
I still need to be ready and prepared.

46:37.628 --> 46:39.296
[laughs]

46:40.047 --> 46:41.673
[thudding]

46:46.470 --> 46:48.347
[In-beom grunts]

46:55.437 --> 46:56.522
[ominous music playing]

46:56.605 --> 46:57.439
TAO TE CHING

47:00.859 --> 47:03.695
SWALLOW THIS AT 1 P.M. TWO DAYS FROM NOW
I'LL GET YOU OUT

47:16.291 --> 47:17.334
[music fades]

47:18.418 --> 47:20.921
[brakes squeal]

47:21.839 --> 47:23.715
[tense music playing]

47:40.566 --> 47:41.650
[car lock beeps]

47:43.986 --> 47:44.987
[exhales]

47:45.946 --> 47:47.322
[sighs with relief]

47:50.158 --> 47:51.243
[music fades]

47:52.286 --> 47:54.746
[man] With this last one,
you have eight in total.

47:54.830 --> 47:55.747
It should be good.

47:55.831 --> 47:57.499
-[Gun-woo] Thank you.
-[Woo-jin] Gun-woo!

47:57.583 --> 47:59.209
-You outside?
-[Gun-woo] Yeah.

48:01.295 --> 48:03.213
Adik's team is leaving today.

48:03.714 --> 48:06.425
Yet, Adik has disappeared.
He's gone missing.

48:06.508 --> 48:07.551
[sighs]

48:08.135 --> 48:10.554
UZBEK BOXER MISSING AFTER TITLE FIGHT.
POLICE INVESTIGATING.

48:10.637 --> 48:11.847
[breathes heavily]

48:11.930 --> 48:12.973
[tense music playing]

48:13.056 --> 48:14.224
I have a bad feeling, Woo-jin.

48:14.808 --> 48:17.728
I think those assholes are behind this.

48:22.441 --> 48:23.483
[music fades]

48:36.496 --> 48:37.664
[suspenseful music playing]

48:37.748 --> 48:38.999
[camera whirs]

49:04.441 --> 49:05.943
Sir, this is the job?

49:08.153 --> 49:09.154
It's just,

49:09.655 --> 49:11.490
why do we have to stoop so low?

49:12.783 --> 49:14.242
We're trained to protect.

49:14.326 --> 49:16.411
[man 1] How does it help to say this now?

49:17.537 --> 49:18.538
We agreed to do it.

49:20.540 --> 49:23.168
Don't you understand
we're about to go under?

49:23.669 --> 49:25.837
We need to pay the other guys too.

49:26.421 --> 49:28.465
Hey. They trusted us.

49:29.049 --> 49:31.385
They worked hard and what did they get?
Broken bodies.

49:31.468 --> 49:33.887
-Yes, I know that, of course, but--
-[man 2] Jin-nam.

49:34.972 --> 49:37.849
Stay in the car. We'll handle it.

49:38.558 --> 49:42.145
[sighs] Mr. Jang,
we can't finish the job with two.

49:43.438 --> 49:44.731
Let's give it a go.

49:44.815 --> 49:46.817
[tense music playing]

49:52.864 --> 49:56.284
[laughs]

49:56.368 --> 49:58.328
[beeping]

49:58.412 --> 49:59.413
[man 3] Bingo.

49:59.496 --> 50:00.330
FRONT DOOR

50:00.372 --> 50:01.206
[lock clicks]

50:07.921 --> 50:09.339
[outgoing call ringing]

50:10.924 --> 50:11.967
Yes?

50:12.551 --> 50:13.635
You can go in.

50:26.273 --> 50:27.274
[Jang] Let's do it.

50:29.526 --> 50:31.528
[dramatic music playing]

50:48.754 --> 50:50.881
[device whirs]

50:50.964 --> 50:52.966
[tense music playing]

51:12.486 --> 51:15.947
[breathes deeply]

51:40.597 --> 51:45.602
[So-yeon gasps, struggles]

51:51.108 --> 51:53.652
-[tense music builds]
-[muffled screaming]

51:58.573 --> 51:59.616
[music fades]

52:01.243 --> 52:02.536
Oh, Mom!

52:02.619 --> 52:04.204
[dramatic music playing]

52:04.287 --> 52:05.789
[both grunt]

52:08.500 --> 52:10.460
-[Woo-jin] Gun-woo!
-[Gun-woo] They're taking her.

52:12.045 --> 52:12.879
-My mom!
-Mom!

52:12.963 --> 52:14.965
-[Jang] Don't fight. I will.
-[man] It's my job.

52:18.802 --> 52:21.680
Shit! You fucker!

52:23.723 --> 52:24.641
[man groans]

52:26.601 --> 52:28.186
[man grunts, yells]

52:29.563 --> 52:32.524
[both grunting]

52:33.108 --> 52:34.192
[groans]

52:36.069 --> 52:38.572
[all grunting]

52:48.081 --> 52:49.958
-[Gun-woo] Woo-jin.
-What is it?

52:50.041 --> 52:51.835
-I've gotta go.
-What?

52:54.963 --> 52:56.089
Gun-woo, are you okay?

52:56.173 --> 52:57.424
[Gun-woo groans]

53:03.054 --> 53:04.264
[gasps]

53:05.223 --> 53:08.101
[panting]

53:08.852 --> 53:09.978
[grunts]

53:10.061 --> 53:13.940
[both straining]

53:19.237 --> 53:21.281
[both grunting]

53:33.251 --> 53:34.377
[groans]

53:34.461 --> 53:36.379
[both grunting]

53:45.180 --> 53:46.806
[groans]

53:54.981 --> 53:56.316
[Taser crackling]

53:58.693 --> 54:00.946
[all grunting]

54:02.197 --> 54:05.617
[groaning]

54:09.079 --> 54:09.996
[both straining]

54:10.080 --> 54:11.998
-[cries out] Ugh!
-[grunts forcefully]

54:14.417 --> 54:15.418
We've gotta go.

54:15.961 --> 54:17.003
[So-yeon groans]

54:17.629 --> 54:18.713
Agh!

54:19.547 --> 54:21.591
[straining]

54:21.675 --> 54:23.593
[Taser crackling]

54:23.677 --> 54:26.972
[all grunting]

54:27.055 --> 54:29.724
-[Taser crackling]
-[groaning]

54:31.726 --> 54:32.894
[grunts]

54:32.978 --> 54:34.938
[heaving]

54:35.021 --> 54:36.189
[both grunting]

54:36.773 --> 54:38.775
[both grunting]

54:57.919 --> 54:59.045
[Taser crackling]

55:11.016 --> 55:14.894
-Shit!
-[straining]

55:23.403 --> 55:25.113
[both straining]

55:36.708 --> 55:40.587
[Taser crackling]

55:42.005 --> 55:44.174
[Gun-woo groans]

55:45.342 --> 55:48.720
[Taser crackling]

55:48.803 --> 55:50.680
-[man groans]
-[bone cracks]

55:54.893 --> 55:56.561
-Oh, oh, oh!
-[man yells]

55:58.855 --> 55:59.773
[Gun-woo gasps]

55:59.856 --> 56:01.483
-[man groaning]
-[Jang] You okay?

56:01.566 --> 56:03.026
-[man] It hurts a lot!
-Gun-woo!

56:03.109 --> 56:05.153
[breathing heavily]

56:10.950 --> 56:12.869
[man groaning]

56:15.163 --> 56:17.248
[Jin] Come on, let's go. Let's leave now.

56:19.459 --> 56:20.543
[music fades]

56:20.627 --> 56:23.505
-[Woo-jin] You okay?
-[groans]

56:23.588 --> 56:26.591
-Here. Can you get up?
-No, my… My mom's there!

56:26.674 --> 56:29.052
-[Gun-woo panting]
-[tense music playing]

56:30.095 --> 56:31.805
[groaning]

56:31.888 --> 56:33.598
-[whimpering]
-Hold on, I've got you.

56:33.681 --> 56:35.558
[groans]

56:35.642 --> 56:38.228
[heaving]

56:38.311 --> 56:39.187
[engine revs]

56:39.896 --> 56:40.939
[Jin] Come on, let's go!

56:44.567 --> 56:45.402
Hey, stop!

56:46.236 --> 56:49.364
Get up! Let's go! Come on!

56:50.657 --> 56:52.659
[dramatic music playing]

56:53.910 --> 56:56.496
-[Jin] Drive faster! Floor it!
-[grunts]

57:14.514 --> 57:16.599
[panting]

57:16.683 --> 57:18.977
[grunts with frustration]

57:21.896 --> 57:24.774
-[groans]
-[exhales]

57:24.858 --> 57:30.905
[groaning continues]

57:36.453 --> 57:39.038
[brakes squeal]

57:48.381 --> 57:50.383
[tense music continues]

57:50.467 --> 57:53.178
[panting]

58:08.234 --> 58:09.277
[music fades]

58:09.360 --> 58:11.362
[dramatic music playing]

01:01:07.372 --> 01:01:08.373
[music fades]
